      "path": "packages/belay-sqlite-model/Belay/Sqlite/Model/DropColumnForeignFacts.lean",
      "rule": "R3",
      "severity": "must",
      "text": "`ParentLink.isLocated_mapChildren` is used by the schema-preservation proof but has no proof sketch. Fix: explain that each parent-link constructor retains its location classification."
    },
    {
